{"ticker":"LITE","updated":"2026-10-23T23:14:18Z","profile":{"longName":"Lumentum Holdings Inc.","shortName":"Lumentum Holdings Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.lumentum.com","fullTimeEmployees":13757,"marketCap":68496035840,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":21.052658,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":22.725956,"pegRatio":0.63,"targetMeanPrice":1165.0314,"targetHighPrice":1500.0,"targetLowPrice":750.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":1.093,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.44244,"operatingMargins":0.27954,"profitMargins":-2.3009598,"totalRevenue":3014000128,"beta":1.536,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1143.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":173.73,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Lumentum Holdings Inc. manufactures and sells optical and photonic products in the Americas, the Asia-Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. It offers component products, including semiconductor laser chips, laser sub-assemblies, line subsystems, and wavelength management systems. The company also offers system products, such as optical modules, optical circuit switches, and industrial lasers, including short-pulse solid-state lasers and kilowatt-class fiber lasers. Its products and solutions are used in cloud, artificial intelligence and machine learning (AI/ML), telecommunications, consumer, and industrial end-market applications. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","summary_zh":"Lumentum Holdings Inc. 在美洲、亞太地區、歐洲、中東和非洲生產和銷售光學和光子產品。它提供組件產品，包括半導體雷射晶片、雷射器子組件、線路子系統和波長管理系統。該公司還提供系統產品，如光模組、光路開關和工業雷射器，包括短脈衝固體雷射和千瓦級光纖雷射。其產品和解決方案用於雲端、人工智慧和機器學習 (AI/ML)、電信、消費和工業終端市場應用。該公司成立於2015年，總部位於加州聖荷西。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"通訊設備","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":120.0,"h":125.4,"l":119.25,"c":123.42,"v":2887600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":124.39,"h":127.03,"l":123.5,"c":124.62,"v":3018600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o